  "operative_text": "Section 1 (NRS 202.2548): 2. The sale or transfer of a firearm by or to any peace officer who is: (a) Employed by a law enforcement agency; and (b) In good standing. A peace officer shall be deemed to be in good standing if the peace officer is not currently suspended without pay."
